<https://w3id.org/lmodel/stix/StixWindowsRegistryKey> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/stix/StixWindowsRegistryValue> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/stix/StixWindowsServiceExtension> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/stix/StixX509Certificate> , <https://w3id.org/lmodel/stix/StixX509V3Extensions> ;
	linkml:default_prefix "stix" ;
	linkml:default_range <https://w3id.org/lmodel/stix/string> ;
	linkml:description "A LinkML model of Structured Threat Information Expression (STIX) Version 2.1, the OASIS Standard for exchanging cyber threat intelligence: its domain, relationship, cyber-observable and meta objects, their properties, vocabularies and enumerations, and the bundle that carries them. STIX's own property names are the schema's keys, so STIX JSON validates unchanged." ;
